g. When : decides whether to run a stage or skip. (23)
stage('deploy') {
    when {
        branch 'main'
    }
}
when {
    expression {
        ......
    } }
h. input : awaits human confirmation (approval/inp) before proceeding
stage('Deploy') {
    steps {
        input message : '....'
    } }
i. Options : controls how jenkins execute and manage pipeline
to timestamps to console log :
options { timestamps() }

